:: Mine Night
<<effects>>

You are in a small cave. The walls are bare. With all the other people in here, it's quite cramped.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	People ignore your <<lewdness>>.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $arousal gte $arousalmax>>
	<<orgasm>>
	You shake and moan. Some slaves look at you, others are unfazed.
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<generate1>>
	You clutch your stomach and go to your knees. A <<person1>><<person>> looks through the gate and notices you. <<He>> quickly opens the gate and rushes to your side. You slip out of consciousness as <<he>> lifts you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Birth]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	You've pushed yourself too much.
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Everything fades to black...|Mine Night Passout]]>><<passout>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lte 20>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>
	A guard opens up the metal gate. "Alright everyone, get to work!" the <<person>> yells. You leave with everyone else.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Intro]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<icon "clothes/boiler-suit.png">><<link [[Grab a boiler suit|Mine Night Suit]]>><</link>>
	<br>

	<<if $mine.bomb.progress gte 10>>
		<span class="blue">You have a bomb ready.</span>
		<br>
	<<elseif $mine.bomb.progress isnot undefined>>
		<<if $mine.bomb.parts gt 0>>
			<<icon "wrench.png">><<link [[Work on the bomb|Mine Bomb Work]]>><<set $mine.bomb.parts-->><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<span class="blue">You need parts to continue working on the bomb.</span>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<icon "socialise.png">><<link [[Converse with other slaves (0:20)|Mine Night Talk]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<if $mine.distraction.night is "complete" or $mine.favor.night is 1>>
		<<icon "socialise.png">><<link [[Ask for a distraction|Mine Night Distraction]]>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>> 

	<<bedicon "zzz">><<link [[Sleep|Mine Rest]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>



:: Mine Bomb Work
<<effects>>

<<if $mine.bomb.progress is 0>>
	You grab a bomb part and try to work it into a usable base.
<<else>>
	You grab a bomb part and try to add on to your base.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if random(100, 200) lte (currentSkillValue('science'))>>
	<<if $mine.bomb.progress is 0>>
		<span class="green">You succeed in adjusting the part to act as a base.</span>
		<<set $mine.bomb.progress++>>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">You succeed in adjusting the part to fit with your base.</span>
		<<set $mine.bomb.progress++>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	While trying to fit in a part, <span class="red">it snaps in your hand.</span>
	<<scienceskill>>
<</if>>

<<if $mine.bomb.progress gte 10>>
	The last part clicks into place, <span class="green">your bomb is finally ready to be used.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Night Distraction
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "mine_night">>
You walk up to the <<person1>><<person>>. "Ready to cash in your favor?" <<he>> asks.
<<unset $mine.favor.night>>
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	You nod. "Can you distract the guards for me?"
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Sure am," you reply. "I need you to distract the guards."
<<else>>
	"Yes," you answer. "I want you to distract the guards."
<</if>>
<<He>> chuckles and leads you behind a large group of people.
<br><br>
"When do you want it done?" <<he>> asks.
<br><br>
<<mine_distract_links "Mine Night Distraction Set">>



:: Mine Night Distraction Set
<<effects>><<set $mine.distraction.night to $phase>><<unset $mine.favor.night>>

You tell <<him>> you want the distraction to happen <<mine_distract_time>>. <<He>> nods, "It'll happen sometime <<mine_distract_time>>. Good luck with whatever you've got planned."
<br><br>
<<He>> looks at the gate and quickly shuffles into the crowd.
<<endevent>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Intro
<<effects>><<generate1>>

A <<person1>><<person>> walks up to you.
<br><br>
<<mine_job>>



:: Mine Night Talk
<<effects>>
You attempt to talk with the other slaves, though most are unwilling.
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "out_of_towner">>
	<<generate1>>
	You talk to a <<person1>><<person>>. "Do you know what country we're in?" <<he>> asks. "I've asked multiple people, but I've gotten many different answers."
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if !["complete","inprogress"].includes($mine.favor.night) and $mine.distraction.night is undefined>>
	<<addinlineevent "request">>
		<<if $mine.favor.night is undefined>>
			<<generate1>>
			<<saveNPC 0 "mine_night">>
			You walk up to a <<person1>><<person>>, but before you can open your mouth to speak, <<he>> speaks first. "You look like someone who can handle <<print $player.gender_appearance is "m" ? "himself" : "herself">>," <<he>> says. "I need a favor, can you get it done?"
			<br><br>
			You open your mouth again, but <<he>> interrupts once more. "Good. Of course, I'll owe you one afterwards."
			<br><br>
			<<mine_night_task>>
			<br><br>
			<<He>> walks away before you can get a word in.
		<<else>>
			<<loadNPC 0 "mine_night">>
			The <<person1>><<person>> walks up to you. "Need another favor, huh?" <<he>> asks. "Good, 'cause so do I."
			<br><br>
			<<mine_night_task>>
			<br><br>
			<<He>> walks away before you can get a word in.
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		<<endevent>>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "nothing">>
	Nobody seems to want to talk to you.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "cheer">>
	<<generatey1>>
	You see a <<person1>><<person>> sitting in the corner. <<He>> looks dejected.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Flirt|Mine Night Flirt]]>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ignore|Mine Night]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "escape_plan">>
	<<generate1>><<generatey2>>
	You overhear two <<people>> talking about an escape plan. "So when we both have mining duty, we break our chains and overpower a guard and hold them hostage," 
	the <<person1>><<person>> says. "So they'll have to let us go! That's genius!" the <<person2>><<person>> says a little too loudly. 
	The <<person1>><<person>> shushes <<person2>><<him>>. <<mine_hope 2>><<gghope>>
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if !$weekly.mine_eavesdrop>>
	<<addinlineevent "eavesdrop">>
		<<set $weekly.mine_eavesdrop to true>>
		Nobody seems to want to talk to you. As you're ready to give up, you hear a faint conversation outside the cave.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Listen in|Mine Night Eavesdrop]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore|Mine Night]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "gems">>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generatey3>>
	You listen in on a conversation between three <<people>>. "I've worked with gems and crystals for years, and I've never seen ones like there are here," the <<person1>><<person>> says.
	<br><br>
	"Must be very valuable. Probably how they can afford this operation," the <<person2>><<person>> posits.
	<br><br>
	"I think there's a conspiracy. A secret group is acquiring them for insidious reasons," the <<person3>><<person>> says. The other two give <<him>> strange looks.
	<br><br>
	<<endevent>>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<runeventpool>>



:: Mine Night Flirt
<<effects>>

You walk up and sit next to <<him>>. You wrap your arm around <<his>> waist and pull yourself into <<him>>. <<He>> looks at you, <<his>> face beet red. You whisper in <<his>> ear, "Don't be sad, I'll make everything okay."
<<promiscuity1>>
<<He>> stammers, trying to say something, but the words don't come out. You separate yourself from <<him>>, satisfied that <<his>> focus has changed. <<mine_hope 2>><<gghope>>

<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Night Eavesdrop
<<effects>>

You get as close to the gate as you can where the guards outside can't see you. You can only hear snippets of the conversation.
<br><br> 
"–in <<nnpc_his "Quinn">> cut…shipment is ready…elk…request for…parts…out of town…used up a lot of them–"
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Night Suit
<<effects>><<upperruined true>><<lowerruined true>><<upperwear "boiler suit">>

You grab a boiler suit out of a bin in the corner and slip it on.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Rest
<<effects>>

You lie down on the rock. It's hard, but you need the rest. You close your eyes to sleep.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Sleep]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Sleep
<<effects>>

<<set _autosavehere to true>>
<<if Time.hour is 21>>
	<<set _mine_sleep to 9>>
<<elseif Time.hour is 22>>
	<<set _mine_sleep to 8>>
<<elseif Time.hour is 23>>
	<<set _mine_sleep to 7>>
<<else>>
	<<set _mine_sleep to (6 - Time.hour)>>
<</if>>
<<for _l to 0; _l lt _mine_sleep; _l++>>
	<<pass 60>>
	<<set $sleepStat++>>
	<<set $tiredness -= 200>>
	<<if !($sleeptrouble is 1 and $controlled is 0 and !$hypnosis_traits.slumber)>>
		<<set $tiredness -= 50>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $hypnosis_traits.slumber>>
		<<set _traumaToSleep to Math.floor($trauma / 100)>>
		<<set $tiredness -= _traumaToSleep>>
	<</if>>
<</for>>

You open your eyes to see the other slaves getting themselves together. Your back aches. <<pain 3>><<gpain>>

<br><br>
<<link [[Get up|Mine Night]]>><</link>>
